  "name": "Plaza Hotel and Casino - Las Vegas",
  "starRating": 3,
  "descriptions": [
    {
      "language": "en",
      "type": "RXLContentId",
      "text": "19"
    },
    {
      "language": "en",
      "type": "SurroundingArea",
      "text": "Plaza Hotel \u0026 Casino is centrally located in Las Vegas, a 3-minute walk from Golden Nugget Casino and 7 minutes by foot from Fremont Street Experience.  This casino hotel is 0.5 mi (0.8 km) from Mob Museum and 0.5 mi (0.9 km) from Fremont Street."
    },
    {
      "language": "en",
      "type": "RoomTypes",
      "text": "Make yourself at home in one of the 995 guestrooms. Complimentary wireless internet access is available to keep you connected. Bathrooms have complimentary toiletries and hair dryers. Conveniences include safes and desks, as well as phones with free local calls."
    },
    {
      "language": "en",
      "type": "PropertyInformation",
      "text": "Head straight for the casino, or wait for that lucky feeling while you enjoy one of the other recreational opportunities, such as an outdoor pool and a spa tub. This hotel also features complimentary wireless internet access, gift shops/newsstands, and wedding services."
    },
    {
      "language": "en",
      "type": "AreaActivities",
      "text": "Distances are displayed to the nearest 0.1 mile and kilometer. \u003Cbr /\u003E \u003Cp\u003EGolden Nugget Casino - 0.2 km / 0.2 mi \u003Cbr /\u003E Four Queens Casino - 0.3 km / 0.2 mi \u003Cbr /\u003E The D Casino Hotel - 0.5 km / 0.3 mi \u003Cbr /\u003E Fremont Street Experience - 0.6 km / 0.4 mi \u003Cbr /\u003E Fremont Street - 0.6 km / 0.4 mi \u003Cbr /\u003E Mob Museum - 0.6 km / 0.4 mi \u003Cbr /\u003E Smith Center for the Performing Arts - 1.1 km / 0.7 mi \u003Cbr /\u003E Discovery Children\u0027s Museum - 1.2 km / 0.8 mi \u003Cbr /\u003E World Market Center - 1.4 km / 0.9 mi \u003Cbr /\u003E The Neon Museum - 1.6 km / 1 mi \u003Cbr /\u003E Zak Bagans Haunted Museum - 2 km / 1.3 mi \u003Cbr /\u003E Little White Wedding Chapel - 2.4 km / 1.5 mi \u003Cbr /\u003E Las Vegas Premium Outlets North - 2.7 km / 1.7 mi \u003Cbr /\u003E Stratosphere Tower - 3.2 km / 2 mi \u003Cbr /\u003E Casino at the Stratosphere - 3.2 km / 2 mi \u003Cbr /\u003E \u003C/p\u003E\u003Cp\u003EThe nearest airports are:\u003Cbr /\u003EHarry Reid Intl. Airport (LAS) - 23.1 km / 14.4 mi\u003Cbr /\u003E Henderson, NV (HSH-Henderson Executive) - 28.4 km / 17.7 mi\u003Cbr /\u003E Boulder City, NV (BLD-Boulder City Municipal) - 42.5 km / 26.4 mi\u003Cbr /\u003E \u003C/p\u003E\u003Cp\u003EThe preferred airport for Plaza Hotel \u0026 Casino is Harry Reid Intl. Airport (LAS). \u003C/p\u003E"
    },
    {
      "language": "en",
      "type": "PoliciesDisclaimers",
      "text": "\u003Cul\u003E  \u003Cli\u003EExtra-person charges may apply and vary depending on property policy\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EGovernment-issued photo identification and a credit card may be required at check-in for incidental charges\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ESpecial requests are subject to availability upon check-in and may incur additional charges; special requests cannot be guaranteed\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ESpecial cancellation policies or charges may apply for group reservations (more than 8 rooms for the same property / stay dates)\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EThis property accepts credit cards and debit cards; cash is not accepted\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ESafety features at this property include a fire extinguisher, a security system, a first aid kit, and window guards\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EPlease note that cultural norms and guest policies may differ by country and by property; the policies listed are provided by the property\u003C/li\u003E  \u003C/ul\u003E \u003Cul\u003E  \u003Cli\u003EAn adult aged 21 or older is required to stay in each guestroom.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EGuests under the age of 21 are not permitted in the casino.\u003C/li\u003E  \u003C/ul\u003E \u003Cul\u003E  \u003Cli\u003EUp to 2 children 12 years old and younger stay free when occupying the parent or guardian\u0027s room, using existing bedding. \u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EThe property has connecting/adjoining rooms, which are subject to availability and can be requested by contacting the property using the number on the booking confirmation. \u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EContactless check-out is available.\u003C/li\u003E \u003C/ul\u003E"
    },
    {
      "language": "en",
      "type": "DiningFacilities",
      "text": "Grab dinner at Oscar\u0027s Steakhouse, a restaurant that specializes in American cuisine. You can also grab snacks at the coffee shop/cafe. Relax with a refreshing drink from the poolside bar or one of the 2 bars/lounges. Cooked-to-order breakfasts are available daily for a fee."
    }
  ],
